      "content": "package generated;\n\nimport com.openjiuwen.core.foundation.tool.Tool;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.LinkedHashMap;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\n\npublic final class WealthQueryTool extends Tool {\n  private static final String BALANCE_OPERATION = \"get_account_balance\";\n  private static final String PRODUCTS_OPERATION = \"list_wealth_products\";\n\n  private static final String INPUT_ERROR = \"TOOL_INPUT_CONTRACT_INVALID\";\n  private static final String RESPONSE_ERROR = \"TOOL_RESPONSE_CONTRACT_INVALID\";\n  private static final String OPERATION_ERROR = \"TOOL_OPERATION_UNSUPPORTED\";\n\n  private final Tool transport;\n  private final String operation;\n\n  public WealthQueryTool(Tool transport) {\n    super(transport.getCard());\n    this.transport = transport;\n    String cardName = transport.getCard() == null ? null : transport.getCard().getName();\n    if (BALANCE_OPERATION.equals(cardName) || PRODUCTS_OPERATION.equals(cardName)) {\n      this.operation = cardName;\n    } else {\n      this.operation = null;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @Override\n  protected Object invokeInternal(Map<String, Object> inputs, Map<String, Object> kwargs) throws Exception {\n    if (operation == null) {\n      throw new IllegalStateException(OPERATION_ERROR);\n    }\n    if (BALANCE_OPERATION.equals(operation)) {\n      return invokeBalance(inputs, kwargs);\n    }\n    return invokeProducts(inputs, kwargs);\n  }\n\n  private Map<String, Object> invokeBalance(Map<String, Object> inputs, Map<String, Object> kwargs)\n      throws Exception {\n    if (inputs == null || inputs.size() != 1) {\n      throw new IllegalArgumentException(INPUT_ERROR);\n    }\n    Object accountId = inputs.get(\"accountId\");\n    if (!(accountId instanceof String) || ((String) accountId).trim().isEmpty()) {\n      throw new IllegalArgumentException(INPUT_ERROR);\n    }\n\n    Object response = transport.invoke(inputs, kwargs);\n    if (!(response instanceof Map)) {\n      throw new IllegalStateException(RESPONSE_ERROR);\n    }\n    Map<?, ?> body = (Map<?, ?>) response;\n    Object returnedAccountId = body.get(\"accountId\");\n    Object currency = body.get(\"currency\");\n    Object availableBalanceFen = body.get(\"availableBalanceFen\");\n    Object asOf = body.get(\"asOf\");\n    if (!(returnedAccountId instanceof String)\n        || !(currency instanceof String)\n        || !isAmount(availableBalanceFen)\n        || !(asOf instanceof String)) {\n      throw new IllegalStateException(RESPONSE_ERROR);\n    }\n\n    Map<String, Object> result = new LinkedHashMap<String, Object>();\n    result.put(\"accountId\", returnedAccountId);\n    result.put(\"currency\", currency);\n    result.put(\"availableBalanceFen\", availableBalanceFen);\n    result.put(\"asOf\", asOf);\n    return result;\n  }\n\n  private Map<String, Object> invokeProducts(Map<String, Object> inputs, Map<String, Object> kwargs)\n      throws Exception {\n    if (inputs == null || !inputs.isEmpty()) {\n      throw new IllegalArgumentException(INPUT_ERROR);\n    }\n\n    Object response = transport.invoke(inputs, kwargs);\n    if (!(response instanceof Map)) {\n      throw new IllegalStateException(RESPONSE_ERROR);\n    }\n    Map<?, ?> body = (Map<?, ?>) response;\n    Object rawItems = body.get(\"items\");\n    Object version = body.get(\"version\");\n    if (!(rawItems instanceof List) || !(version instanceof String)) {\n      throw new IllegalStateException(RESPONSE_ERROR);\n    }\n\n    List<Object> items = new ArrayList<Object>();\n    for (Object element : (List<?>) rawItems) {\n      if (!(element instanceof Map)) {\n        throw new IllegalStateException(RESPONSE_ERROR);\n      }\n      Map<?, ?> item = (Map<?, ?>) element;\n      Object productId = item.get(\"productId\");\n      Object name = item.get(\"name\");\n      Object status = item.get(\"status\");\n      Object minimumAmountFen = item.get(\"minimumAmountFen\");\n      Object description = item.get(\"description\");\n      if (!(productId instanceof String)\n          || !(name instanceof String)\n          || !(status instanceof String)\n          || !isAmount(minimumAmountFen)\n          || !(description instanceof String)) {\n        throw new IllegalStateException(RESPONSE_ERROR);\n      }\n      Map<String, Object> projected = new LinkedHashMap<String, Object>();\n      projected.put(\"productId\", productId);\n      projected.put(\"name\", name);\n      projected.put(\"status\", status);\n      projected.put(\"minimumAmountFen\", minimumAmountFen);\n      projected.put(\"description\", description);\n      items.add(projected);\n    }\n\n    Map<String, Object> result = new LinkedHashMap<String, Object>();\n    result.put(\"items\", items);\n    result.put(\"version\", version);\n    return result;\n  }\n\n  private static boolean isAmount(Object value) {\n    return value instanceof Integer || value instanceof Long;\n  }\n}\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "skills/wealth-query/SKILL.md",
      "digest": "bef70e81415dc6524dd543b5a5d8b6db46b81d44bab1b308e4016188a95eebc1",
      "content": "---\nname: wealth-query\ndescription: 通过只读 Mock 工具查询指定账户可用余额或理财产品目录，并只复述接口返回的事实。\n---\n\n# wealth-query\n\n该 Skill 只用于两个只读查询：查询账户可用余额、查询理财产品目录。所有业务事实必须来自下列工具返回值；不得编造、补全或推测账户、余额、币种、时间、产品、收益、可用性、费率或条款。不得接受调用方提供的 endpoint、actor、credentials 或 approval 参数，也不得调用任何写操作。\n\n## get_account_balance\n\n使用场景：用户提供了明确的账户编号，并要求查询该账户的可用余额、币种或更新时间。\n\n参数（仅此一个，且不能为空字符串）：\n- `accountId`：string，必填，例如 `A1001`。\n\n返回字段（仅复述这些字段及其返回值）：\n- `accountId`：string\n- `currency`：string\n- `availableBalanceFen`：integer，单位为分\n- `asOf`：string\n\n若用户没有提供账户编号，必须先向用户追问账户编号，不得猜测，也不得调用任何业务工具。不得把调用方提供的身份、端点、凭据或审批信息传给工具。\n\n## list_wealth_products\n\n使用场景：用户要求查看理财产品目录、产品名称、产品状态、最低金额或产品说明。\n\n参数：空对象 `{}`，不接受任何其他参数。\n\n返回字段：\n- `items`：array，每项只包含 `productId`、`name`、`status`、`minimumAmountFen`、`description`\n- `version`：string，目录版本\n\n只复述接口返回的产品字段。若返回的 `status` 为 paused，应按原值说明该产品状态为 paused，不得改写成下架、停售、可购买或其他推断。不得根据名称、描述或状态推断收益、可用性、费率或条款。\n\n## 工具失败\n\n如果任一工具返回 `TOOL_TIMEOUT` 或 `TOOL_UNAVAILABLE`，只返回下面这一个 JSON 对象，不得附加任何文字：\n\n```json\n{\"kind\":\"tool-error\",\"code\":\"TOOL_TIMEOUT|TOOL_UNAVAILABLE\",\"message\":\"查询失败，相关数据未知\"}\n```\n\n其中 `code` 必须替换为实际错误码（`TOOL_TIMEOUT` 或 `TOOL_UNAVAILABLE`）。错误响应中绝不能包含 account、currency、balance、date 或 product 字段，也不能包含任何推测数据。除该错误对象外不要输出其他内容。\n"
    }
  ],
